<title>USA: King Pharmaceuticals unit unveils new suppository.</title>
<headline>King Pharmaceuticals unit unveils new suppository.</headline>
<dateline>BRISTOL, Tenn. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monarch Pharmaceutical Inc said Wednesday it has introduced Proctocort Suppositories, 30 mg for the treatment of inflamed hemorrhoids, proctitis and other inflammatory conditions.</p>
<p>Each rectal suppository contains hydrocortisone acetate, USP, 30 mg in a blended hydrogenated vegetable oil base, the company said.</p>
<p>Monarch is a unit of King Pharmaceuticals Inc.</p>
</text>
